{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"查理·芒格·生平与时代","stage":"DONE","category":"charlie-munger","categoryLabel":"查理·芒格","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/04_charlie-munger/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生平与时代\">生平与时代</h1><p>本卷讲述查理·芒格（Charlie Munger，1924 年 1 月 1 日—2023 年 11 月 28 日）的人生历程：从内布拉斯加州奥马哈一个律师家庭的嗜书少年，到密歇根大学辍学入伍、加州理工学气象、哈佛法学院极优等毕业的青年，再到洛杉矶顶级律所的创办者、与沃伦·巴菲特携手缔造伯克希尔·哈撒韦传奇的投资大师。芒格的一生横跨近一个世纪，深深烙刻着美国中西部勤勉、节俭、崇尚常识的文化底色。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷-分工边界\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷：分工边界</h2><p>本卷《生平与时代》只讲&quot;芒格其人其事&quot;——他何时、何地、与谁、做了什么。他的<strong>思想内容本身</strong>（多元思维模型、投资原则、误判心理学、终身学习、影响与争议）由以下兄弟卷分别系统展开，本卷只在相关处以相对路径链接，不重复展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>与本卷的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>本卷 1·生平与时代</td>\n<td>生平事实、时间线、人际</td>\n<td>何人何事何时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2·核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>多元思维模型、投资原则、理性决策</td>\n<td>思想&quot;是什么&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3·思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>误判心理学、多学科方法、终身学习</td>\n<td>方法&quot;怎么做&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4·代表成就</a></td>\n<td>《穷查理宝典》、伯克希尔投资、演讲</td>\n<td>具体产出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5·影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>对投资界的影响、思维模型运动</td>\n<td>后世影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6·争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>批评、辩论、总体评价</td>\n<td>如何评判</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"本卷结构与推荐学习路径\">本卷结构与推荐学习路径</h2><p>本卷分三章，按时间顺序排列，建议依序阅读：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>早年与求学</strong><ul>\n<li><a href=\"early-life/omaha-boyhood\">奥马哈的少年时代</a>——1924 年出生、律师家庭、嗜书、巴菲特家杂货店打工</li>\n<li><a href=\"early-life/law-and-early-career\">法律生涯与早年事业</a>——密歇根/Caltech/哈佛、1962 创办律所、惠勒-芒格投资公司（1962-75 年化 19.8%）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>与巴菲特的合作</strong><ul>\n<li><a href=\"partnership-with-buffett/the-meeting\">与巴菲特的相遇</a>——1959 奥马哈晚宴、巴菲特的劝说</li>\n<li><a href=\"partnership-with-buffett/the-berkshire-duo\">伯克希尔的黄金搭档</a>——1978 任副主席、1972 喜诗糖果重塑投资哲学、半个世纪的信任</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>晚年与暮年</strong><ul>\n<li><a href=\"later-life/reading-and-architecture\">阅读、建筑与多元人生</a>——终身阅读、密歇根&quot;无窗宿舍&quot;争议、慈善</li>\n<li><a href=\"later-life/the-final-years\">最后的岁月</a>——丧子/失明/丧偶的坚韧、对加密货币的批评、2023 年辞世</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[&quot;早年与求学&lt;br/&gt;1924-1948&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;法律与早年事业&lt;br/&gt;1948-1965&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;与巴菲特相遇&lt;br/&gt;1959&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;伯克希尔黄金搭档&lt;br/&gt;1978-2023&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;多元人生&lt;br/&gt;阅读·建筑·慈善&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;最后的岁月&lt;br/&gt;2023 辞世&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n  A[\"早年与求学&lt;br/&gt;1924-1948\"] --&gt; B[\"法律与早年事业&lt;br/&gt;1948-1965\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"与巴菲特相遇&lt;br/&gt;1959\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"伯克希尔黄金搭档&lt;br/&gt;1978-2023\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"多元人生&lt;br/&gt;阅读·建筑·慈善\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"最后的岁月&lt;br/&gt;2023 辞世\"]</pre><h2 id=\"前置与读法\">前置与读法</h2><p>本卷无硬性前置知识，适合作为了解芒格的起点。若读者已熟悉投资术语（价值投资、护城河、能力圈），阅读&quot;与巴菲特的合作&quot;一章会更顺畅；不熟悉也不妨碍——相关概念均链接到兄弟卷 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>。透过芒格的生平，读者将看到一位理性、博学、正直，且在巨大苦难中始终坚韧的智者，是如何在漫长岁月中淬炼出非凡智慧的。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life","title":"早年与求学","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/life-and-times/early-life","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"omaha-boyhood","title":"奥马哈的少年时代","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/life-and-times/early-life/omaha-boyhood"},{"seq":2,"slug":"law-and-early-career","title":"法律生涯与早年事业","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/life-and-times/early-life/law-and-early-career"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"partnership-with-buffett","title":"与巴菲特的合作","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/life-and-times/partnership-with-buffett","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-meeting","title":"与巴菲特的相遇","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/life-and-times/partnership-with-buffett/the-meeting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-berkshire-duo","title":"伯克希尔的黄金搭档","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/life-and-times/partnership-with-buffett/the-berkshire-duo"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"later-life","title":"晚年与暮年","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/life-and-times/later-life","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reading-and-architecture","title":"阅读、建筑与多元人生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/life-and-times/later-life/reading-and-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-final-years","title":"最后的岁月","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/life-and-times/later-life/the-final-years"}]}]}